# Splice onto Arcane (CR 702.47a-b): any number of different cards may be spliced onto one spell, each once. Bot1 casts
# Hex Magic with three Through the Breach cards spliced onto it, paying {2}{R} and {2}{R}{R} three times (fifteen mana).
# Hex Magic exiles the three revealed cards from the hand and draws three Ornithopters; then each spliced text, in the
# order spliced, puts one Ornithopter onto the battlefield with haste (CR 702.47c).

